# Note: using a symlink to a directory (like fonts => usr/share/fonts-fork-awesome/fonts)
# won't work as dpkg can't properly replace an actual directory (from th
# previous package version) to a symlink.
# So create one symlink per font file instead.
# See: https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=626203
